Comment: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,IN“Little stranger”
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.18,0:20:23.64,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}Hey there little stranger
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.19,0:20:27.61,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}You’re right I don’t even know your name
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.46,0:20:33.22,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}Such a mysterious creature
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.89,0:20:37.28,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}I’ve stumbled upon my way
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.84,0:20:44.21,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}What is the answer can you tell
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.01,0:20:53.51,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}I swear I feel like I’ve never felt
Dialogue: 1,0:20:56.22,0:21:02.70,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}I look around and there’s no one here
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.73,0:21:12.24,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}Don’t tell me you’re just another one of my dreams
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.24,0:21:21.63,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}The walls are crushing the windows open and I fall
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.25,0:21:30.25,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}Flying through all the mistakes I have done
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.67,0:21:39.65,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}I see it clearly all of the disappointed faces
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.04,0:21:50.59,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}I see the damage I’ve caused in their own spaces
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.95,0:21:58.28,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}I was a liar I was not worth of being trusted
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.05,0:22:07.55,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}I was a mugger mugged closest people stole their hearts and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.54,0:22:15.90,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}Now I know that’s why I am alone
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.30,0:22:24.85,IN-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}Hey little stranger thank God you’re finally home
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:23.64,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}你好  陌生人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.19,0:20:27.61,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}確實  我們素昧平生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:33.22,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}這種生物難以捉摸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.89,0:20:37.28,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}我已舉步維艱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:44.21,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}你的回答是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.01,0:20:53.51,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}這感覺前所未有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.22,0:21:02.70,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}四顧茫然  我已孤身一人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.73,0:21:12.24,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}不要說你只是我的虛夢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:21.63,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}世界分崩離析  將我跌出窗外
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.25,0:21:30.25,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}我的罪過在身旁一晃而過
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.67,0:21:39.65,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}失望的臉龐刻在我的視網膜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.04,0:21:50.59,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}我造成的傷痕不曾消失
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:58.28,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}謊話連篇的我  不值得相信
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.05,0:22:07.55,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}向至親之人下手  偷走了他們的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.54,0:22:15.90,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}現在醒悟為何伶仃孤苦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.30,0:22:24.85,IN-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\fax-0.2\blur3\3c&HBC3101&}再見  陌生人  願上帝保佑你的歸途
Comment: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,ED“Let You Down”
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.63,0:22:51.80,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}They will finally feel the flames
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.98,0:22:56.17,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}Flames that run down through my veins
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.51,0:23:00.52,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}I will make this city burn
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.73,0:23:04.88,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}We’re not planning to return
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.73,0:23:09.56,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}Trying so hard to be free
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.90,0:23:13.16,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}To make you see what I see
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.56,0:23:18.40,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}Hold on to your wishes
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.40,0:23:22.05,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}If you can’t hold on to me
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.39,0:23:25.17,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}Forgive me for letting you down
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.92,0:23:30.83,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}Forgive me for letting you down again
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.17,0:23:34.25,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}I guess I’m not strong enough
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.96,0:23:37.68,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}Right now
Dialogue: 1,0:23:38.10,0:23:39.18,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}Let you down
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.18,0:23:45.19,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}Oh, my love
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.19,0:23:49.64,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}Love
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.64,0:23:57.12,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}Love
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.44,0:23:56.15,ED-JP_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(360,360)\blur3}Oh, let you down
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.63,0:22:51.80,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}人們終將感受到火焰
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.98,0:22:56.17,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}在我血管中燃燒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.51,0:23:00.52,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}火光照亮城市
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.73,0:23:04.88,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}一去不復返
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.73,0:23:09.56,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}為了自由而奮鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.90,0:23:13.16,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}為了你我能看見
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.56,0:23:18.40,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}堅持你的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.40,0:23:22.05,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}如果不再對我期待
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.39,0:23:25.17,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}原諒我讓你失望
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:30.83,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}原諒我再次讓你失望
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.17,0:23:34.25,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}我自知不夠強大
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.96,0:23:37.68,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}如今
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:39.18,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}讓你失望
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.18,0:23:45.19,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}我的摯愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.19,0:23:49.64,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}摯愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.64,0:23:57.12,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur3}摯愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.44,0:23:56.15,ED-CH_EP02,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(360,360)\blur3}讓你失望
Comment: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:06.00,Dial-CH,,0,0,0,,
